<title>POLAND: Rolimpex H1 net falls to PLN 16.3 mln.</title>
<headline>Rolimpex H1 net falls to PLN 16.3 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rolimpex SA results for period ending June 30.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						H1 1996     H1 1995</p>
<p>    operating				40.20  vs    37.02</p>
<p>    pre-tax				  23.63  vs    34.45</p>
<p>    net					16.32  vs    21.45</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Rolimpex SA. @</p>
<p>    net sales			     635.57  vs   447.55</p>
<p>    costs of sales			531.55  vs   370.53</p>
<p>    extraordinary loss		    0.01  vs     0.01</p>
<p>    income tax				7.31  vs    12.99</p>
<p>    other taxes			     0.00  vs     0.00</p>
<p>    financial revenues		    7.26  vs    10.74</p>
<p>    financial costs			23.85  vs    13.30</p>
<p>    depreciation			    2.80  vs     1.91</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
